WEBVTT

00:02:58.132 --> 00:03:02.845
Surely we have values, insights,
strategies and knowledge to offer

00:03:02.887 --> 00:03:06.807
to the rest of the global community
with respect to how to be a part of

00:03:06.807 --> 00:03:08.601
and care for our environment.

00:03:09.393 --> 00:03:11.687
This knowledge is essential right now.

00:03:12.188 --> 00:03:18.110
It can help people and the land heal
from ecological crises and colonization.

00:03:18.611 --> 00:03:20.613
It can help restore the planet

00:03:20.613 --> 00:03:22.406
and it can help save us all.

00:03:23.074 --> 00:03:27.203
By fully respecting and acknowledging
Indigenous-led approaches to the land,

00:03:27.245 --> 00:03:30.414
we can help create
a better future for all.